      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think something like this that should be implemented is automatic LOD model creation. A system to automatically decimate (lower the polycount) and remove features like lights and particles at certain distances where they would mostly be invisible anyway.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-03-11T23:03:25.878Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is obviously hard, but, it would be nice if the VRChat SDK performed some general avatar optimizations at upload time, like automated texture atlasing, combining skinned mesh renderers, normalizing shader keywords, etc.\n\nIt could possibly be an opt-in option in the settings pane, in case it breaks things for some people.",
